# --- C.R.I.S.S.P.: never in an image -------------------------------------------------------------
# Only runtime code goes into an image. Never exclude a path a Dockerfile COPYs: after merging these rules, check with
# a build that every COPY path is still in the context.
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump
backups
**/.DS_Store
CRISSP.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
backlog
testsuite
docs/stories
